gin{bmatrix}{k}^{2}{x}^{2} \\\\ k\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={k}^{2}\\begin{bmatrix}{x}^{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne kT\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{T}$ is not a linear transformation.\n\n- Checking the second condition, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{1}+{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}({x}_{1}+{x}_{2})^{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}^{2}+2{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+{x}_{2}^{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}^{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2}^{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{1}{x}_{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{1}{x}_{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nAs a result, only statement “$T$ is **NOT** a linear transformation” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348353 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6b9bdc7e-42c3-53cc-a18e-22ffa2e86bb5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469134} {:answer/id #uuid "361c69af-6a32-5d90-a2fa-6b0197287d40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469135}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "361c69af-6a32-5d90-a2fa-6b0197287d40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469135} :answer-field/id #uuid "cd53690d-e07b-5da6-966c-bd269499edd7" :answer-field/key "$T(kv)=kT(v)$ for any real $2\\times 1$ column vector $v$ and real scalar $k$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/