 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}x+y \\\\ 2y\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A linear transformation $T$ satisfies two properties:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & T\\begin{bmatrix}kx \\\\ ky\\end{bmatrix}=kT\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}, \\\\  & T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{1}+{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Checking the first condition, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\begin{bmatrix}kx \\\\ ky\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}kx+ky \\\\ 2(ky)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}k(x+y) \\\\ k(2y)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =k\\begin{bmatrix}x+y \\\\ 2y\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =kT\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Checking the second condition, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{1}+{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{y}_{1}+{y}_{2} \\\\ 2({y}_{1}+{y}_{2})\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{y}_{1} \\\\ 2{y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2}+{y}_{2} \\\\ 2{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{T}$ is a linear transformation.\n\nAs a result, all three statements are true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186351471 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ae458531-3fea-5d4a-9fef-16784006df96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469290} {:answer/id #uuid "70a6a5c7-d36a-5ba3-beef-83d4658904d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469291}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "70a6a5c7-d36a-5ba3-beef-83d4658904d8" :answer