 =kT\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Checking the second condition, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{1}+{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5({x}_{1}+{x}_{2})+2({y}_{1}+{y}_{2}) \\\\ 3({y}_{1}+{y}_{2})\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5{x}_{1}+2{y}_{1} \\\\ 3{y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}5{x}_{2}+2{y}_{2} \\\\ 3{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{T}$ is a linear transformation.\n\nAs a result, all three statements are true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186351472 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "78f2bbb7-924e-519b-858e-8781702c24be" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469296} {:answer/id #uuid "1d466783-f476-5fdd-b2b1-7f9609e90817" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469297}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1d466783-f476-5fdd-b2b1-7f9609e90817" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469297} :answer-field/id #uuid "96bcc72e-3fee-5a08-ad21-87ada1e18d29" :answer-field/key "$T(kv)=kT(v)$ for any real $2\\times 1$ column vector $v$ and real scalar $k$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470260} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ede2e360-cb72-5597-9136-07fadf25f445" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469298} {:answer/id #uuid "c34902f6-f6b8-58a7-9994-5b38c62f7aa2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469299}]