nd{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Checking the first condition, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\begin{bmatrix}kx \\\\ ky\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}kx+ky \\\\ 4kx+3ky\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =k\\begin{bmatrix}x+y \\\\ 4x+3y\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =kT\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Checking the second condition, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{1}+{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{y}_{1}+{y}_{2} \\\\ 4({x}_{1}+{x}_{2})+3({y}_{1}+{y}_{2})\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{y}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+3{y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2}+{y}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{2}+3{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{T}$ is a linear transformation.\n\nAs a result, all three statements are true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186396176 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f34066f-00d4-55b1-8d73-96ef234a63ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471627} {:answer/id #uuid "40aeb5d5-faee-5b7e-8df5-e870d6e9a6e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471628}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2f34066f-00d4-55b1-8d73-96ef234a63ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471627} :answer-field/id #uuid "27ba3123-b0fe-5ec0-9a8d-2073c4afa0b4" :answer-field/key "$T(kv)=kT(v)$ for any real $2\\times 1$ column vector $v$ and real scalar $k$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472319} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3317098d-cf9d-5045-941b-07580beb38db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471629} {:answer/id #uuid "cef4ff68-717a-544a-9ae5-83dfb3142903" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471630}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3317098d-cf9d-5045-941b-07580beb38db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471629} :answer-field/id #uuid "75df2837-8fbd-5207-9ab7-c0c5f47ed8b5" :answer-field/key "$T({v}_{1}+{v}_{2})=T({v}_{1})+T({v}_{2})$ for any real $2\\times 1$ column vectors ${v}_{1}$ and ${v}_{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472320} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "839e484e-16dc-5c22-99f9-7b695e23ac7b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471631} {:answer/id #uuid "d9f23ace-b866-586d-8acb-fe6dd49060d9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471632}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d9f23ace-b866-586d-8acb-fe6dd49060d9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471632} :answer-field/id #uuid "64c08e3e-68be-5c0c-ab6e-798878cc578f" :answer-field/key "$T$ is **NOT** a linear transformation" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472321} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "73094d67-fb89-53ba-9609-29680c80b381" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669209} {:answer/id #uuid "8eff3264-7a98-59c0-b008-d94b7ad1ace3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669210}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "73094d67-fb89-53ba-9609-29680c80b381" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669209} :answer-field/id #uuid "4b770e3f-645d-5cce-8948-9224033f2035" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669404}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "72a3fd90-5133-5a81-a0e8-33ac74b2d520" :question/math-academy-id "q-8049" :question/problem "Let \n$$\n\\displaystyle T:\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ x\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A linear transformation $T$ satisfies two properties:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & T\\begin{bmatrix}kx \\\\ ky\\end{bmatrix}=kT\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}, \\\\  & T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{1}+{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Checking the first condition, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\begin{bmatrix}kx \\\\ ky\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ kx\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne kT\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{T}$ is not a linear transformation.\n\n- Checking the second condition, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{1}+{y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+T\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, only statement “$T$ is **NOT** a linear transformation” is true."}] :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Linear Transformations"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087747 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087563 :question/id #uuid "8fe1f455-e739-59cb-95c2-0378dff32b8e" :question/math-academy-id "e-5428" :question/problem "If $\\mathbf{T}$ is a linear transformation and $$\n\\mathbf{T}\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ 24\\end{bmatrix}\\right)=\\begin{bmatrix}18 \\\\ -30\\end{bmatrix},\n$$ then find $\\mathbf{T}\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\right).$" :question/worked-solution "Since $\\mathbf{T}$ is a linear transformation, it must satisfy $\\mathbf{T}(k\\mathbf{v})=k\\mathbf{T}(\\mathbf{v}).$ Noting that $\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ 24\\end{bmatrix}=6\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ 24\\end{bmatrix}\\right) & =T\\left(6\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\right)=6T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since we're told that \n\n$$\n\\mathbf{T}\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ 24\\end{bmatrix}\\right)=\\begin{bmatrix}18 \\\\ -30\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nwe must have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\right) & =\\begin{bmatrix}18 \\\\ -30\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\right) & =\\frac{1}{6}\\begin{bmatrix}18 \\\\ -30\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\right) & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ad1c29f7-c0e7-5bed-944f-a2e33579c7b8" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088151 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0c2d6a47-226c-51b2-aa28-dfaecd733285" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321246} {:answer/id #uuid "228b70b6-639a-5ccb-b768-59755ded8a6c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-15 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321409} {:answer/id #uuid "8bee971f-0454-50dc-8309-af67a2173b38" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322267} {:answer/id #uuid "8e6df426-6d51-555b-8f28-989da2b1d1ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322278} {:answer/id #uuid "ec686057-fe80-53a4-9e32-072ae2451bdb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186323005}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0c2d6a47-226c-51b2-aa28-dfaecd733285" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321246} :answer-field/id #uuid "ece5ffa6-7324-5536-acf5-dd7b49cfbb63" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186323635}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "95ad2111-91ad-555b-a492-6ecabaa23b77" :question/math-academy-id "q-37903" :question/problem "If $\\,T\\,$ is a linear transformation and $\\,T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix}\\right)=\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix}$, then find $\\,T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\\right).$" :question/worked-solution "Since $T$ is a linear transformation, it must satisfy $T(kv)=kT(v).$ Noting that $\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix}=3\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix}\\right) & =T\\left(3\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\\right)=3T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since we're told that \n\n$$\nT\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix}\\right)=\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nwe must have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\\right) & =\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\\right) & =\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\\right) & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088152 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b6e75859-bf4a-5324-9d39-88794cb734f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-16 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186085567} {:answer/id #uuid "e8e899f3-59b7-5e19-8215-549c6a34610c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186085568} {:answer/id #uuid "eeb6e954-9336-596d-95e0-926945793282" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186085569} {:answer/id #uuid "5980461f-9439-5512-872a-db9e91563a6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186085570} {:answer/id #uuid "619aae0d-deef-5ea2-a589-e2f483e1b3fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186085571}] :answer-field/id #uuid "4a792685-a259-5c9e-a283-03b2f35fd2d3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186085566}] :question/id #uuid "811ef69d-2826-