d-solution "First, since ${v}_{1}+{v}_{2}=0,$ we have that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{v}_{1}+15{v}_{2} & =15{v}_{1}-6{v}_{1}+15{v}_{2} \\\\  & =15({v}_{1}+{v}_{2})-6{v}_{1} \\\\  & =15(0)-6{v}_{1} \\\\  & =-6{v}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nT(9{v}_{1}+15{v}_{2})=T(-6{v}_{1}).\n$$\n\nNow, since $T$ is a linear transformation, we have that $T(kv)=kT(v).$ So \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(-6{v}_{1}) & =-6T({v}_{1}) \\\\  & =-6\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -30\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn conclusion, $T(9{v}_{1}+15{v}_{2})=\\begin{bmatrix}-12 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -30\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299648 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d8d567ff-2c0f-5b01-a277-bdc34f50b08a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "39" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298481}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d8d567ff-2c0f-5b01-a277-bdc34f50b08a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "39" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298481} :answer-field/id #uuid "24448da8-7cec-5162-b7bd-b737f959ab7c" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298758} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8e2a33bb-dd8e-5512-9401-ab165d9e1392" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298168}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8e2a33bb-dd8e-5512-9401-ab165d9e1392" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298168} :answer-field/id #uuid "5bf4c268-bb86-5fd3-a7b9-7a1fb8eb974f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298950} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uu